~ start
do Global.text_start.emit()
Pilot: Welp, here we are.[wait=1]
Pilot: Listen bud, I know you're probably scared, but what you're doing is really important
Pilot: You're a real hero willing to sacrifice yourself for the benefit of mankind.
Pilot: First thing I'm gonna do once this is all over is celebrate on the beach in your honor!
- Can you please tell me why I'm here, no one actually explained why.
	Pilot: Yeah [wait=1] you're the one whose gonna blow up the nuke.
- Why exactly did you bring me out here?
	Pilot: to blow up the nuke, duh.

Pilot: no one told you?
- WHAT!
	Pilot: Woah chill out.
- What nuke?
	Pilot: the one over there behind me.

Pilot: yeah that was the whole plan remember?
Pilot: Go to the North pole, blow up the polar ice cap so the world cools down.
Pilot: You know... cause the World is kinda frozen over?
Pilot: Anyway... I'm gonna get going now, just go over there and activate it and we'll all be proud [wait=1]or whatever
Pilot: Oh and please set a timer for 20 minutes, that'll give me enough time to get out of the blast raidus.
Mind: [wave]*You notice the pilot is reaching behind him and staring back at you strangely, listening closely to what you will say next.*[/wave]

if Global.has_alien_device and Global.has_gun:
	- Use Mind Control Device
		Pilot: Hugh what happend? [wait=1] My head hurts like crazy!
		- You are going to blow up the nuke and set it for 20 minutes from now
			Pilot: [wave]I will blow up the nuke in 20 minutes[/wave]
			Pilot: [wave]Anything you say is my command.[/wave]
			Mind: [wave]*Well that was easy*[/wave]
			Mind: [wave]*Time to get out of here*[/wave]
			set Global.kill_pilot = true
			do Global.text_end.emit()
			do Global.choose_time.emit()
			=> END!
		- These are not the droids you are looking for
			Pilot: [wave]These are not the droids we are looking for[/wave]
			You: Also go blow up that nuke in 20 minutes.
			Pilot: [wave]I will blow up the nuke in 20 minutes[/wave]
			Mind: [wave]*Well that was easy*[/wave]
			Mind: [wave]*Time to get out of here*[/wave]
			set Global.kill_pilot = true
			do Global.text_end.emit()
			do Global.choose_time.emit()
			=> END!
	- Pull out gun and shoot Pilot
		Pilot: woah woah buddy! Let's talk about this...
		You: Do you really think I'm stupid enough to believe in all this hero nonsense? I knw what you guys were planning this whole time.
		You: Not like it really matters. Once you're gone I'm taking the plane and flying far away from here.
		Pilot: Listen. You can't just leave me here. I've got people waiting for me back at base. If this plane doesn't come back they'll look for you.
		Pilot: I know my way back, you don't...
		Pilot: Not like you'll get far. The worlds still frozen over, you're not gonna sit on some beach in a lawn chair soaking up the sun anyways.
		Pilot: You know what? It doesn't matter what you do to me now. We're both dead as I see it. You just don't have anything to lose like me.
		Pilot: Go ahead. Just make it quick... please...
		set Global.shoot_pilot = true
		do Global.pilot_dead_lol.emit()
		do Global.text_end.emit()
		do Global.choose_time.emit()
		=> END!
	- I'm scared! I'm not ready to die.
		do Global.pilot_with_gun.emit()
		Pilot: Well, I can't take you back.
		Pilot: Sorry bud, this is the way it's gotta be.
	- Please take me back! I'm not doing this!
		do Global.pilot_with_gun.emit()
		Pilot: Sorry bud, strict orders to not take you back
		Pilot: Once you're here it's decided.
